     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi D-RUGgies,<div><br></div><div>It&#39;s time to vote on days/times for winter quarter  (2018!!) meetups. Please fill out the following google form:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/EW2Rd4ktw8Sj7twy2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/EW2Rd4ktw8Sj7twy2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466653769000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XHV6HP-1GX365GVIAVqSc\">https://goo.gl/forms/EW2Rd4ktw8Sj7twy2</a><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><div>In addition, if folks are interested in presenting next quarter, please let me know! We&#39;ve had some great presentations this quarter, and I&#39;d like to keep that going into next quarter.</div><div><br>Depending on the day/time that works for most folks, we may or may not be able to use the DSI space, but can probably use Wickson again if need be.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks all and looking forward to seeing whomever can drop by.</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inli